<title>FRANCE: French demand seen rising in Q3 - survey.</title>
<headline>French demand seen rising in Q3 - survey.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>French manufacturing demand is expected to rise in the third quarter by the same rate as in the second quarter, national statistics institute INSEE said in its quarterly industrial survey.</p>
<p>Demand has improved in all sectors of manufacturing since January, but remained weak in the car sector, the survey said.  </p>
<p>INSEE gave the following data, seasonally adjusted unless stated. A positive figure shows the percentage points by which the percentage of respondents saying things had improved or risen outnumbered the percentage saying things had worsened.</p>
